    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(14th Level)</em></p><p><em>“Outcomes stand. Framing is negotiable.”</em></p><p>Once per Soma Break, after a significant event resolves, you may choose its framing:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Heroic Framing:</strong> Reduce unrest, fear, Darkness fallout.</p></li><li><p><strong>Cautionary Framing:</strong> Increase deterrence against repetition.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ambiguous Framing:</strong> Reduce exploitation and follow-up manipulation.</p></li><li><p><strong>Sealed Record:</strong> Prevent political or magical weaponization.</p></li></ul><p>You cannot change the outcome—only its interpretive gravity.</p><h3>Cost</h3><p>Limited use. No Surge required.</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>Altering framing too aggressively increases Noise, especially if it denies narrative consequences.</p>",
